2 CONC ones oratorum pontificiorum,1524-1526), Budapest 1884, passim; Römische Dokumente zur Geschichte der Ehescheidung Heinrichs VIII. von England, a cura di S. Ehses, Paderborn 1893, pp. VIII, 152 s., 164-66, 175 s., 185 s., 191-93, 2
2 CONC 03; M. Sanuto, Diarii, XLI, Venezia 1894, col. 115; XLII, ibid. 1895, coll. 109, 230, 236-41, 2708, 339 s., 349, 420, 635, 637-39; XLIII, ibid. 1895, coll. 19, 38; Calendar of state papers and manuscripts,existing in the archives 
2 CONC and collections of Milan, I, a cura di A. B. Hinds, London 1912, pp. 524, 527; Die Korrespondenz Ferdinands I., I, a cura di W. Bauer, Wien 1912, pp. 213, 392; G. Fráknoi, Le baron B., nonce de Clément VII en Hongrie (1523-1526), 
2 CONC Florence 1884; P. Friedmann, Anna Boleyn. A chapter of English history 1527-1536, I, London 1884, pp. 143 s., 179-81, 184 s., 190 s., 203 s., 298; L. v. Pastor, Gesch. der Päpste, IV, 2, Freiburg i. Br. 1907, pp. 234, 437-442; E. 
