1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://www.iagiforum.info/viewtopic.php?f=2&t=5412 iagiforum.info ... ] ; [http://www.regione.sicilia.it/beniculturali/bibliotecacentrale/mango/grifeo.htm Nobiliario di sicilia... ] ; 
2 CONT * Eccomi qui con un quesito per immagini.
2 CONT *  '''Vincenzo I Grifeo, IX principe di Partanna'''.
2 CONT * English translation about the family Grifeo or Graffeo '''Grifeo or Graffeo'''
2 CONT * Ancient and noble Sicilian family, which is of Greek origin, and wants to from Nicephorus Focas. Possessed principalities of Partanna and Hooks, the duchies of Ciminna, Floridia and Gualteri; the marquisates Serradifalco, and Mi
2 CONC raelrio, the baronies of Protonotaro, Tripura, customs Fondaco of Trapani, the saline Montefranco, the trap S. Nicholas, etc.. George was a rational master of the kingdom, and in 1365 owned the estate Torretta, Peter was a warden 
2 CONC of Trapani in 1422, Jerome was a praetorian court of Palermo in 1579-80, a Mario, Prince and Duke of Partanna Ciminna, was governor the noble company of Charity in 1641, governor of the pawnshop in Palermo in 1647, judge of the sa
2 CONC me city in 1646-47, a Dominic, Prince of Partanna, was governor of the noble company of Whites in 1656-57, a Jerome, Prince Partanna, was sheriff of Palermo in 1710-11, judge of the same city in 1732-33, a Giambattista Grifeo and 
2 CONC Papè, Marquis Miraelrio, was governor of the Monte di Pieta in 1724 and held the same post Ignatius, brother of earlier, which was also a senator from Palermo in 1724-25, a Benedict, Prince and Duke of Partanna Ciminna, was sherif
2 CONC f of Palermo in 1748-49 and in 1758-59, a Jerome, Prince of Partanna, knight of ' Order of San Gennaro, was sheriff in 1771-72-73 and 1782-83-84 in the magistrate, a Benedict Grifeo and Del Bosco, was Member of Parliament in 1786,
2 CONC  the Palermo Senator in 1799-1800, etc.., Prince of Partanna and Duke of Ciminna and Floridia etc..; Grifeo and '''Vincenzo Maria Migliaccio''', son of the former, received investiture of the title of '''Prince of Partanna''' to J
2 CONC une 10, 1812, was '''knight of the Golden Fleece''' and the order of S. Januarius, Knight of Honour and Devotion of the Order of Malta, Knight of Justice of the Constantinian, state councilor, gentleman of the chamber of the king 
2 CONC of the Two Sicilies, Envoy Extraordinary and Minister Plenipotentiary to the Court of Prussia, etc.., Had Gravina '''wife''' Agatha, Princess of Palagonia, Princess of Lercara, Duchess of Valverde, Duchess of Alcara, Francofonte M
2 CONC arquise, Marquise Delia, Bifara Marquise, Marquise Antella, Baroness of Calatabiano, etc.. etc. ..
2 CONT * Weapon: Gold, truncated by a fillet of blue in 1, a black vulture through the partition on the 2 ° three bars azure.
2 CONT
