2 CONC lass="western" style="margin-bottom: 0cm;" align="center"><span style="font-size: medium;"><strong>Principe di Roccapalumba oggi Soria (1)</strong></span></p> <p><span style="font-size: medium;"><span style="font-size: medium;"></
